</p><ul><li>Retail volume sales increased by 5% in 2025 to 94 million units.</li><li>Computers is the best performing category in 2025, with retail volume sales rising by 6% to 78 million units.</li><li>Apple Inc. is the leading player in 2025, with a retail volume share of 24%.</li><li>Retail volume sales are set to fall at a CAGR of 3% over the forecast period to 80 million units.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="d_flex flex-wrap_wrap gap_spacing-xxlarge rg_spacing-small"><div data-testid="tag" class="d_flex tag tag--type_article tag--cursor_default"><div data-testid="icon-Article" class=""><svg aria-hidden="true" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="icon icon--color_default" style="fill:var(--colors-white);stroke:none;width:var(--sizes-sizing-medium);height:var(--sizes-sizing-medium)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M21 6.79565H3V5.29565H21V6.79565ZM21 12.7957H3V11.2957H21V12.7957ZM3 18.75H13V17.25H3V18.75Z"></path></svg><p class="typography typography--size_body-regular typography--screenReader_true typography--hasLineClamp_false">Article</p></div><p class="typography typography--size_tag-text typography--hasLineClamp_false">27 mins</p></div><p class="typography typography--size_body-regular-short typography--hasLineClamp_false">17 December 2025</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex_1 print-visible_true"><div class="d_flex flex-d_column ai_flex-start gap_spacing-xsmall md:gap_spacing-small"><h1 class="typography typography--size_heading-xxlarge typography--hasLineClamp_false c_text-header">Computers and peripherals in the US</h1></div><div class="d_flex flex-d_column ai_flex-start gap_spacing-medium md:gap_spacing-large"><div class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_spacing-small"><p class="typography typography--size_body-large typography--hasLineClamp_false">Euromonitor report with data and analysis of the US computer and peripheral market.</p><p class="typography typogr