</p><ul><li>Retail volume sales increased by 5% in 2025 to 94 million units.</li><li>Computers is the best performing category in 2025, with retail volume sales rising by 6% to 78 million units.</li><li>Apple Inc. is the leading player in 2025, with a retail volume share of 24%.</li><li>Retail volume sales are set to fall at a CAGR of 3% over the forecast period to 80 million units.</li></ul></div></div></p><p class="typography typography--size_body-regular typography--hasLineClamp_false">17 December 2025</p></div></div></div><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><div class="phoenix-app-pos_fixed phoenix-app-bottom_2.4rem phoenix-app-right_1.6rem phoenix-app-z_5 phoenix-app-print-hidden_true"></div></div><!--$?--><template id="B:1"></template><!--/$--></div><div aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-testid="toast-announcer-assertive" class="typography typography--size_body-regular typography--screenReader_true typography--hasLineClamp_false"></div><div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-testid="toast-announcer-polite" class="typography typography--size_body-regular typography--screenReader_true typography--hasLineClamp_false"></div><div class="pos_fixed d_flex gap_spacing-small z_35 left_0 right_0 mx_auto w_fit-content min-w_min-content px_spacing-medium pointer-events_none [&amp;_&gt;_*]:pointer-events_auto top_spacing-huge flex-d_column-reverse" data-testid="toast-container-top"></div><div class="pos_fixed d_flex gap_spacing-small z_35 left_0 right_0 mx_auto w_fit-content min-w_min-content px_spacing-medium pointer-events_none [&amp;_&gt;_*]:pointer-events_auto bottom_spacing-huge flex-d_column" data-testid="toast-container-bottom"></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-b89c6e4ac4ab9ae1.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><div hidden id="S:0"><nav class="d_flex flex-d_column pos_sticky top_0 w_full trs_transfo