gencies, media owners and academic institutions with the tools to create effective marketing. ​\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet a WARC subscription and unlock full access to our industry insights, unbiased evidence and expert guidance – so you can drive better business outcomes.​\u003c/p\u003e\",\"buttons\":[{\"href\":\"/subscribe?referrer=Computers and peripherals in the US\",\"label\":\"WARC powers impactful marketing. Learn how.\"}],\"buttonSupportText\":\"\",\"logo\":{\"alt\":\"WARC\",\"href\":\"/\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F1e8574dde0344e78be7badd3d8cbc1bb%2Fb2772fc94553448e9f75816644d89571\"},\"media\":{\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F1e8574dde0344e78be7badd3d8cbc1bb%2F2e363caa0d9e43dcbfa89a80425b76b4\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"signInButton\":{\"label\":\"Sign in\"},\"signInButtonSupportText\":\"Already a subscriber?\",\"tagline\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Access this content with a WARC subscription.\"},\"variant\":\"standard\"}]]\n"])</script></body></html>